        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x,y)=\\left(\\frac12,-\\frac74\\right)$",
          "worked": "Subtract the first equation from the second.\n$$\\begin{align*}12x&=6\\\\x&=\\frac12\\\\7\\left(\\frac12\\right)-2y&=7\\\\\\frac72-2y&=7\\\\-2y&=\\frac72\\\\y&=-\\frac74\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $(x,y)=\\left(\\frac12,-\\frac74\\right)$.",
