          "short": "$(x,y)=\\left(\\frac72,-4\\right)$",
          "worked": "Subtract the first equation from the second.\n$$\\begin{align*}5y&=-20\\\\y&=-4\\\\2x-2(-4)&=15\\\\2x+8&=15\\\\2x&=7\\\\x&=\\frac72\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $(x,y)=\\left(\\frac72,-4\\right)$.",
